<v Ira Glass>我们的节目今天由纳迪亚·雷曼制作。制作今天节目的人包括比姆·阿德温米、苏珊·伯顿、本·卡尔霍恩、达娜·奇维斯、肖恩·科尔、努尔·吉尔、达米安·格雷夫、米歇尔·哈里斯、查纳·乔夫-沃尔特、赛斯·林德、米基·米克、丽娜·米西齐斯、斯托·尼尔森、本·费伦、罗宾·塞米恩、莉莉·沙利文、克里斯托弗·斯韦塔拉和马特·蒂尔尼。

01:00:22.410 --> 01:00:40.740
<v Ira Glass>Our managing editor is Diane Wu. Our executive editor is David Kestenbaum. Special thanks today to Kelly Clarke, Craig Hensel, Kendra Hanna, Kendra [? Munroe, ?] Madeleine Ball, Andrew Hagelshaw, and Maria Hernandez. Our website, thisamericanlife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange.
<v Ira Glass>我们的执行编辑是黛安·吴。我们的执行编辑是戴维·克里斯滕鲍姆。今天特别感谢凯莉·克拉克、克雷格·亨塞尔、肯德拉·汉娜、肯德拉·[门罗？]、马德琳·鲍尔、安德鲁·黑格尔肖和玛丽亚·埃尔南德斯。我们的网站，thisamericanlife.org。《美国生活》由PRX（公共广播交易所）分发给公共广播电台。

01:00:40.740 --> 01:01:08.570
<v Ira Glass>And I will end this show about the low hum of menace with this very theme appropriate program note. Just a few hours ago, as I was doing some last editing on the show, I learned that a few days ago I shook hands with somebody who now has symptoms of coronavirus, whose wife is a confirmed case. So the plan is I am going into quarantine myself when I leave the studio today, and we are shutting down our office. Most everybody in our office was already working from home.
<v Ira Glass>我将以这个非常贴合主题的节目说明来结束这一期关于低沉威胁感的节目。就在几小时前，当我正在对节目进行最后编辑时，我得知几天前我和某人握了手，那人现在有了新冠病毒症状，他的妻子是确诊病例。所以计划是，我今天离开录音室后就自我隔离，我们要关掉办公室。我们办公室里几乎所有人都已经在居家办公了。

01:01:08.570 --> 01:01:36.550
<v Ira Glass>I just want to say I feel fine. Hopefully I'll stay that way between now and next time I talk to you. Avoid contact with others as much as you can. Stay well, and wash your hands, OK? And by the way, if you're tired of reciting the happy birthday song twice as you wash, turns out one chorus of the song "Stayin' Alive" is the perfect length, and whether you're a brother, or whether you're a mother, just stay alive. Stay alive.
<v Ira Glass>我只想说我感觉很好。希望从现在到下次和你谈话时，我能保持这样。尽可能避免与他人接触。保重，洗手，好吗？顺便说一句，如果你厌倦了在洗手时唱两遍生日快乐歌，事实证明唱一遍比吉斯乐队的《活下去》（Stayin' Alive）副歌长度刚好，不管你是兄弟，还是母亲，只要活着。活着。

01:01:36.550 --> 01:01:41.550
